e noted but maybe can be coached. Others have more severe deficits: C's unwillingness to further education, egocentric; D's moody/loner; A's unfriendly and health.\n\nThus I will recommend Candidate B.\n\nMake contribution: state recommendation Candidate B, reference that we have no prior discussion, mention B's strengths and weaknesses, compare to others.\n\nProceed."}
